### 1. 구독 생성 (user-1, BUILD_FAILED, SLACK)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "channel": "SLACK"
}

### 2. 구독 추가 (user-1, BUILD_FAILED, EMAIL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "channel": "EMAIL"
}

### 3. 구독 추가 (user-2, BUILD_FAILED, WEBHOOK)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-2",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "channel": "WEBHOOK",
  "webhookUrl": "https://example.com/webhook"
}

### 4. 이벤트 생성 — notificationCount: 3 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: step3-test-001

{
  "source": "jenkins",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "payload": "PR #42 빌드 실패"
}

### 5. user-1 알림 조회 — QUEUED 상태 2건 (SLACK, EMAIL)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications?userId=user-1

### 6. user-2 알림 조회 — QUEUED 상태 1건 (WEBHOOK, metadata 포함)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications?userId=user-2

### 7. 멱등성 테스트 — 같은 키로 다시 요청, notificationCount: 0 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: step3-test-001

{
  "source": "jenkins",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "payload": "PR #42 빌드 실패"
}

### 8. 구독 없는 이벤트 — notificationCount: 0 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: step3-test-002

{
  "source": "monitoring",
  "eventType": "DEPLOY_COMPLETED",
  "payload": "배포 완료"
}
